KryptonOS Theme Studio & Wallpaper Hub (GTK 3.0)
Allows choosing preset developer themes, switching categorized wallpapers
(Landscape, Anime & Characters, Movie & Cinema, Minimal), and crafting custom desktop themes.
Live updates Hyprland, Waybar, Kitty Terminal, Dock, and Wallpapers.
"""
